#: ../doc/keyboard.rst:201
msgid "**Left/right** follows the current track first. When no item remains in that direction, it continues to the closest item start on another track."
msgstr ""

#: ../doc/keyboard.rst:204
msgid "**Up/down** looks above or below the selected item, preferring items that overlap it in time. The nearest overlapping track wins. If nothing overlaps, the smallest horizontal gap wins, then the nearest track. Ties on a track favor the closest item center. Empty tracks and unrelated items farther to the side do not block navigation. With no selection, the playhead supplies the starting position."
msgstr ""

#: ../doc/keyboard.rst:210
msgid "**Selection at the playhead** cycles from the highest track to the lowest, then wraps to the top. Moving the playhead restarts the cycle. If no item is under it, the selection stays unchanged. Extending selection keeps items already selected."
msgstr ""

